              </?01M17DRPAKS2R3FWEWXKCTS29V>
            ]>
          )>
        ]>
        <Gate [
          <Criterion #P2-G1 { checked = true } ?01M17DRPAKS2R3FWEWXKCTS29W>
          Focused runtime tests prove repeated observe/decide/admit cycles and reconstruction with no parallel graph authority.
          </?01M17DRPAKS2R3FWEWXKCTS29W>
        ]>
      )>
      <TaskGroup #P3 { name = "Conformance and independent direction review" status = "DONE" priority = "P1" order = 2 } (
        <Description ?01M17DRPAKS2R3FWEWXKCTS29X>
